<<
/A 58 0 R
/Alt (Warning sign graphic and two street scenes at night. The first street scene shows a road with a red caution triangle on the right, trees lining the side, and buildings in the background. The second street scene features a similar setup during the day, with vehicles on the road, trees, and the red caution triangle visible again.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 45 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
