27 0 obj
<<
/A 58 0 R
/Alt (Flowchart illustrating an experiment involving novice and experienced drivers. Both groups, consisting of 16 participants each, undergo familiarization, including a mission description and demographic questionnaire. The timeline includes city daytime and night driving scenes with random risks appearing without AR warning. Participants' risk perception times are measured. An AR system build section follows, with a UMUX questionnaire completed. The process aims to assess risk perception and build trust in AR systems. Markers indicate experienced drivers, novice drivers, AR time, and risk appearance time.)
/K 1
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 50 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
